Datasets
--------

modelport does not ship any dataset. examples/datasets/prepare.py downloads the
following public datasets on demand. Credit goes to their authors:

- Fashion-MNIST: Han Xiao, Kashif Rasul and Roland Vollgraf (2017),
  "Fashion-MNIST: a Novel Image Dataset for Benchmarking Machine Learning Algorithms".
  MIT License. https://github.com/zalandoresearch/fashion-mnist

- EuroSAT: Patrick Helber, Benjamin Bischke, Andreas Dengel and Damian Borth (2019),
  "EuroSAT: A Novel Dataset and Deep Learning Benchmark for Land Use and Land Cover
  Classification". MIT License. https://github.com/phelber/EuroSAT

- Covertype: Jock A. Blackard (1998), UCI Machine Learning Repository.
  CC BY 4.0. https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/31/covertype
